From 7908378841e5deb09ed1ed9f8a0f5b3a736240a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergei Trofimovich <slyich@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 26 Apr 2022 23:49:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SoundMgr.cpp: give more bytes to theme path

On NixOS package prefixes are a bit longer than usual /usr.
This causes stack overflow at path creation time:

```
